msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Please note that if you would like to use Elliptic Curve keys with "
"Kubernetes Client then adding a BouncyCastle PKIX dependency is required:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Note that internally an `org.bouncycastle.jce.provider.BouncyCastleProvider` "
"provider will be registered if it has not already been registered."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can have this provider registered as described in the xref:security-"
"customization.adoc#bouncy-castle[BouncyCastle] or xref:security-"
"customization.adoc#bouncy-castle-fips[BouncyCastle FIPS] sections."
msgstr ""

